  "translate_en|mods/Dry & Cure/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_DC_AdvancedDryingStation": "Capacity: 12 pieces per batch.<br>Nominal drying time: 48 hours.<br>Nutrition depends on the actual size and value of the foods used.<br>Rain, wetness and ambient temperature affect performance.",
