  "translate_en|mods/Dry & Cure/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_DC_ProfessionalDryingStation": "Capacity: 20 pieces per batch.<br>Fixed drying time: 24 hours.<br>Nutrition depends on the actual size and value of the foods used.<br>Its covered design is immune to weather and temperature penalties.",
  "translate_en|mods/Dry & Cure/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_DC_StationPart": "Requires parts 1/2 and 2/2 of the same station tier.<br>Carry one part; the other may be on the ground within 2 tiles.<br>Place using the furniture menu. Rotate with R."
